            "detailed_description": "<h1>To Be Announced (TBA)</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound effects, lights and UI improvements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Store in-game integration</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DLC</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/749830/extras/dd53edc7928fdd84ded7b9a6f16c42c9.avif?t=1791514706\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/749830/extras_big/dd53edc7928fdd84ded7b9a6f16c42c9.avif?t=1791514706 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From a point not too far off in the sky... a faithful magnetic witness!</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/749830/extras/dd53edc7928fdd84ded7b9a6f16c42c9.avif?t=1791514706\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/749830/extras_big/dd53edc7928fdd84ded7b9a6f16c42c9.avif?t=1791514706 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From a point not too far off in the sky... a faithful magnetic witness!</p>",
