                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "41585341",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198046979223",
                            "num_reviews": 296,
                            "playtime_forever": 34,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 34,
                            "last_played": 1524223055
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It's alright.\nThe gameplay is simple but the levels get harder as you go on and it always felt satisfying to me at least. I beat it on the first try which took about 25 minutes so IDK if it's worth the money really, but it did feel like it to me.\nI really like the animation of the zombies, they have this lurching walk that looks very creepy. I would say they are the best looking 2D zombies I've seen so that was pretty cool. The backgrounds and art overall were nice too, I'm not a big fan of pixel/retro art-styles but this game looks nice enough with it.\nOne thing I don't understand is the money you collect, as there wasn't a shop or anything so I'm not really sure what that was for.\nThe text is in broken English in places which is a shame, but overall it's a nice little game.",
